    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/fc16af461ebf97ad06f2f2b47ff5907a.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/fc16af461ebf97ad06f2f2b47ff5907a.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rune Song</strong> is a 2D action / adventure platformer with an emphasis on <strong>fluid movement,</strong>\u00a0a unique cast of <strong>vibrant characters, </strong>and light <strong>combat elements</strong>!\u00a0Inspired by games such as <strong>Celeste</strong>, <strong>Shovel Knight</strong>, and <strong>Night In The Woods</strong>, Rune Song aims to blend well crafted level design with alluring dialogues and simple but satisfying player movement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f60a7b94e192bd2aa87c891fa8dbdda1.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f60a7b94e192bd2aa87c891fa8dbdda1.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/7362507017eb5830d58b089613b8e8de.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/7362507017eb5830d58b089613b8e8de.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/7362507017eb5830d58b089613b8e8de.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Baba, a fledgling wizard working at his grandparents <strong>magical bakery</strong>. After a gang of notorious <strong>pastry thieves</strong> loot the restaurant, it's up to you to traverse a mysterious whimsical world, navigate intricate challenges, and track the thieves to their den for some well deserved <strong>payback</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/87740845af4644986050d769c400ba1a.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/87740845af4644986050d769c400ba1a.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/52654048f7d3f049a4c376642083561e.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/52654048f7d3f049a4c376642083561e.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/52654048f7d3f049a4c376642083561e.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, swim, and crawl your way through a <strong>dozen</strong> handcrafted stages, each consisting of beautifully stylized <strong>pixel art</strong> with an attention to subtle details. Every location is wholly unique with stage specific environments, mechanics, and characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/7347360722298b0a8c3d7808f9efc277.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/7347360722298b0a8c3d7808f9efc277.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/112d406f239361776d0ff2379b378e39.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/112d406f239361776d0ff2379b378e39.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/112d406f239361776d0ff2379b378e39.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not all pastry parties and friendly faces in the world of Rune Song. Ranging from the most minor of slimes to a literal <strong>god of death</strong>, Baba will have plenty of foes to overcome  with his trusty <strong>fireball </strong>spell! Just don't forget to manage your mana bar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/c16d9ae0e4f10c64c859c90e573cc210.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/c16d9ae0e4f10c64c859c90e573cc210.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/fccd0ec63d053893e7f7ee89ad53e4e6.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/fccd0ec63d053893e7f7ee89ad53e4e6.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/fccd0ec63d053893e7f7ee89ad53e4e6.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your adventures, you'll experience the <strong>heart</strong> of what Rune Song has to offer, the unique array of <strong>memorable characters</strong> that inhabit the world. Running the gamut from friendly and endearing to goofy and slightly unhinged, there's no shortage of interesting characters  to interact with! Or don't! Most dialogues are completely <strong>optional</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/11d3fac54838cc96fa92cc605161123b.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/11d3fac54838cc96fa92cc605161123b.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/df0896d1a8331f20be28fc44249e5d42.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/df0896d1a8331f20be28fc44249e5d42.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/df0896d1a8331f20be28fc44249e5d42.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is teeming with\u00a0<strong>treasures</strong> and <strong>gold coins</strong> just waiting to be discovered. The further you venture off the beaten path, the more you'll be rewarded! Loot is the only way to <strong>upgrade</strong> your character and more importantly, have the funds for the biggest and best <strong>pastry party</strong> around!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/0426f9529e97ef67103861ee750151e4.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/0426f9529e97ef67103861ee750151e4.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f3bbfb36f0280d4d579f18bf31241325.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f3bbfb36f0280d4d579f18bf31241325.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f3bbfb36f0280d4d579f18bf31241325.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If variety is the spice of life, then Rune Song is a veritable witches brew of optional <strong>side quests</strong>! One of which consists of helping a witch complete her witches brew! There's always someone who could use a hand so make sure to do your part if you're feeling generous, you may even be <strong>rewarded</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/86b49a31aa55d51716ccf73de914c27f.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/86b49a31aa55d51716ccf73de914c27f.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f0be61a0c4c23f0b84352c403b2bf45a.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f0be61a0c4c23f0b84352c403b2bf45a.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f0be61a0c4c23f0b84352c403b2bf45a.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who doesn't love a good secret? I'll let slip a little something right now by telling you that Rune Song has loads of <strong>hidden locations</strong>, <strong>secret treasure chests</strong>, and tucked away <strong>challenge gauntlets</strong>! Players with a keen eye and sense of <strong>discovery</strong> will always have a reason to closely examine their surroundings!\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/fc16af461ebf97ad06f2f2b47ff5907a.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/fc16af461ebf97ad06f2f2b47ff5907a.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rune Song</strong> is a 2D action / adventure platformer with an emphasis on <strong>fluid movement,</strong>\u00a0a unique cast of <strong>vibrant characters, </strong>and light <strong>combat elements</strong>!\u00a0Inspired by games such as <strong>Celeste</strong>, <strong>Shovel Knight</strong>, and <strong>Night In The Woods</strong>, Rune Song aims to blend well crafted level design with alluring dialogues and simple but satisfying player movement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f60a7b94e192bd2aa87c891fa8dbdda1.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f60a7b94e192bd2aa87c891fa8dbdda1.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/7362507017eb5830d58b089613b8e8de.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/7362507017eb5830d58b089613b8e8de.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/7362507017eb5830d58b089613b8e8de.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Baba, a fledgling wizard working at his grandparents <strong>magical bakery</strong>. After a gang of notorious <strong>pastry thieves</strong> loot the restaurant, it's up to you to traverse a mysterious whimsical world, navigate intricate challenges, and track the thieves to their den for some well deserved <strong>payback</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/87740845af4644986050d769c400ba1a.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/87740845af4644986050d769c400ba1a.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/52654048f7d3f049a4c376642083561e.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/52654048f7d3f049a4c376642083561e.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/52654048f7d3f049a4c376642083561e.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, swim, and crawl your way through a <strong>dozen</strong> handcrafted stages, each consisting of beautifully stylized <strong>pixel art</strong> with an attention to subtle details. Every location is wholly unique with stage specific environments, mechanics, and characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/7347360722298b0a8c3d7808f9efc277.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/7347360722298b0a8c3d7808f9efc277.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/112d406f239361776d0ff2379b378e39.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/112d406f239361776d0ff2379b378e39.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/112d406f239361776d0ff2379b378e39.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not all pastry parties and friendly faces in the world of Rune Song. Ranging from the most minor of slimes to a literal <strong>god of death</strong>, Baba will have plenty of foes to overcome  with his trusty <strong>fireball </strong>spell! Just don't forget to manage your mana bar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/c16d9ae0e4f10c64c859c90e573cc210.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/c16d9ae0e4f10c64c859c90e573cc210.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/fccd0ec63d053893e7f7ee89ad53e4e6.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/fccd0ec63d053893e7f7ee89ad53e4e6.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/fccd0ec63d053893e7f7ee89ad53e4e6.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your adventures, you'll experience the <strong>heart</strong> of what Rune Song has to offer, the unique array of <strong>memorable characters</strong> that inhabit the world. Running the gamut from friendly and endearing to goofy and slightly unhinged, there's no shortage of interesting characters  to interact with! Or don't! Most dialogues are completely <strong>optional</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/11d3fac54838cc96fa92cc605161123b.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/11d3fac54838cc96fa92cc605161123b.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/df0896d1a8331f20be28fc44249e5d42.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/df0896d1a8331f20be28fc44249e5d42.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/df0896d1a8331f20be28fc44249e5d42.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is teeming with\u00a0<strong>treasures</strong> and <strong>gold coins</strong> just waiting to be discovered. The further you venture off the beaten path, the more you'll be rewarded! Loot is the only way to <strong>upgrade</strong> your character and more importantly, have the funds for the biggest and best <strong>pastry party</strong> around!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/0426f9529e97ef67103861ee750151e4.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/0426f9529e97ef67103861ee750151e4.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f3bbfb36f0280d4d579f18bf31241325.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f3bbfb36f0280d4d579f18bf31241325.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f3bbfb36f0280d4d579f18bf31241325.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If variety is the spice of life, then Rune Song is a veritable witches brew of optional <strong>side quests</strong>! One of which consists of helping a witch complete her witches brew! There's always someone who could use a hand so make sure to do your part if you're feeling generous, you may even be <strong>rewarded</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/86b49a31aa55d51716ccf73de914c27f.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/86b49a31aa55d51716ccf73de914c27f.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f0be61a0c4c23f0b84352c403b2bf45a.poster.avif?t=1753235177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f0be61a0c4c23f0b84352c403b2bf45a.webm?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429280/extras/f0be61a0c4c23f0b84352c403b2bf45a.mp4?t=1753235177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who doesn't love a good secret? I'll let slip a little something right now by telling you that Rune Song has loads of <strong>hidden locations</strong>, <strong>secret treasure chests</strong>, and tucked away <strong>challenge gauntlets</strong>! Players with a keen eye and sense of <strong>discovery</strong> will always have a reason to closely examine their surroundings!\u00a0</p>",
